  "solution": "**Given**\n\nP + Q = 2R …… (1)\n\nR + S = 2P …… (2)\n\n**From equation (1)**\n\nQ = 2R − P\n\n**From equation (2)**\n\nS = 2P − R\n\n**Q + S**\n\nQ + S = (2R − P) + (2P − R)\n\n= 2R − P + 2P − R\n\n= R + P\n\nSo, P + R=Q + S\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is Option 1**.",
